United Kingdom sanctions on Sudanese military commanders are progress worth knowing, targeting

00:07:00.149 --> 00:07:05.869
officers suspected of atrocities, including conflict-related sexual violence during the fall

00:07:05.869 --> 00:07:11.449
of El Fasher, and all Africa reports the measures hit individuals linked to specific incidents in

00:07:11.449 --> 00:07:16.609
