00:07:22.629 --> 00:07:27.569
The sanctions freeze any United Kingdom assets held by those targeted, and generally bear

00:07:27.569 --> 00:07:31.929
British persons from dealing with them, so money parked in Britain cannot be used,

00:07:31.929 --> 00:07:35.069
